==Description==
The '''Patriotic Crate''' is a seasonal crate released for the 4th of July. This crate yields 6 American-themed skins. It can be purchased for {{Coins|4,500}} in the store, or for {{Robux|199}}.

Each skin that can be obtained from the '''Patriotic Crate''' has a rarity which affects how likely you are to unlock the skin and the price when it appears in the Daily Skin Store. In the Daily Skin Store, {{Color|Common}} skins cost {{Coins|4,500}}, {{Color|Uncommon}} skins cost {{Coins|5,250}}, {{Color|Rare}} skins cost {{Coins|6,500}} and {{Color|Legendary}} skins cost {{Coins|10,000}}.

==Methods of Obtaining==
#Purchasable in the store for {{Coins|4,500}} or {{Robux|199}}.
